abstract: "Public source snapshot of an HCI research prototype (UIST 2026 Poster) that conducts a natural-language life-story interview to construct an inspectable, editable personal biography, relationship/decision graph, and mental-model digital twin, paired with a Reigns-style college/campus social choice simulation for reflective decision-making. See NOTICE.md for reuse terms."
